    <item>
      <title>Luxos 0.12.0 (33)</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 23:26:23 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>33</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.12.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Luxos 0.12.0</h3><ul><li>Let stable releases publish: the title&#x27;s beta suffix stopped the script under set -e</li><li>Rebuild Luxos Remote for iPhone around executors, in the desktop&#x27;s design</li><li>Redesign the app around Scenes and Playback, with executors, single cues and a real timeline editor</li><li>Tilt and turn effects through depth, and reverse their direction</li><li>Layer cues over looks; let one-shots stack and release; fix iOS release and Done</li><li>Switch fixtures between RGB and RGBW from the inspector</li><li>Add the Luxos launch site (luxos.theprism.pro)</li><li>Add signed releases and in-app updates (Sparkle) with Stable and Beta channels</li><li>Add Luxos Remote, an iPhone app that runs a shared Luxos from the room</li><li>Add Show mode: run the show without drawing it on the show Mac</li><li>Show QLab-style progress, countdown and fade on Sequence cue list rows</li><li>Let a QLab cue run the whole cue list or a timeline</li><li>Add local QLab cue synchronization with Luxos playback</li><li>Add remote editing (phase 2): edit the host&#x27;s installation from a connected Luxos</li><li>Add remote sessions (phase 1): share a show, live view and playback control over the LAN</li><li>Add V1 installation files: Chromadance, Dopamine Entrance Tunnel, Euphoria Grove, Lumination Lane, Cushion Clash</li><li>Add lit surfaces, diffuser shells, pixel groups and per-wall wiring pages</li><li>Lay 2D canvases on the floor, add daisy-chain cables and wiring from an existing patch</li><li>Add 3D layout editor, wiring and power planning, scene objects, RGBW and MCP agent access</li><li>Fix UI lag and opening shared .luxos files</li><li>Add trigger cues, custom shapes, and QLab song shows</li><li>Add faster strobe rates and tile-aligned effect mapping</li><li>Add pixel mapping, bulk fixture editing, and protected background output</li><li>Add DMX watcher for generated, submitted, and accepted channel data</li><li>Add automatic tempo sync and musical accents to Music Auto</li><li>Add Music Auto effect with audio-driven looks and transitions</li><li>Add desktop audio modulation and procedural effects for 0.5.0</li><li>Separate Preview executable identity to restore local network output</li><li>Add image alpha, extended blends, and whole-group editing</li><li>Add linked layer groups and brightness masks</li><li>Add GPU composition filter stacks and native editors</li><li>Fix Create effect selection and functional parameter controls</li><li>Initial Luxos native macOS development build</li></ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/j8urney/luxos-releases/releases/download/v0.12.0/Luxos-0.12.0-33.zip" length="8262707" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="esZQ2MFrfznSMashF8d5oTQJgbSPbqrU2GIEbOWFcNRfvS1kGjLMVlR3yMqPyJHqaaCItTddVcDULbwJrffWBw=="/>
    </item>
